{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>From heaven</b> — for all decrees come from heaven. The meaning of 'You caused to be heard': when all inhabitants of the earth hear that You sat on the throne and judged in truth, then those remaining of You will fear, and each will grow quiet in his place and not come to Your holy city to wage war against it." "And some say: the meaning of 'the earth feared' — the wicked." "'And was quiet' — the righteous."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 76, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:40.714886071Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}